card.statement:
[Operator form of the KZ-Equations] For $x\in\mathfrak F_m^*$ of weight $\alpha\in\mathbb C$, set

$$
\Delta(\alpha,\mu):=\frac{\alpha(\alpha-2\mu)}{4}\quad \text{and}\quad \hat\Phi^W_x(z):=z^{-\Delta(\mu,\alpha)}\tilde\Phi^W_x(z),
$$

where $\mu$ is fixed (see \secref{mu}). The operator $\hat{\Phi}_x^W(z):W_{\lambda,\kappa}\longrightarrow W_{\lambda-m,\kappa}\hat{\otimes}\mathfrak F_m[z,z^{-1}]\cdot z^{-\Delta}$ satisfies the differential equation

\begin{equation}
\boxed{
\frac{d}{dz}\hat\Phi^W_x(z)=\hat\Phi_{fx}^W(z) \partial_za^*(z)  +  \dfrac{\alpha}{2} :b(z) \hat\Phi_{x}^W(z):  }
\end{equation}
